pageType: content
background: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
elements:
  - elementId: accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 54, 108, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent2"}
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 82, 500, 20]
    content:
      color: "$accent2"
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 1.5
      text: 07 · START HERE
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 130, 700, 70]
    content:
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontSize: 42
      bold: true
      text: 现在就开始设计你的 PPT
  - elementId: copy
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 226, 590, 70]
    content:
      color: "#D7E6F4"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: 先给出主题和交付目标，再选择提示词、内置示例或外部视觉参考。hello-my-ppt 会把结果保留为可继续编辑的本地项目。
  - elementId: command-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 344, 864, 74]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#0B2032"}
  - elementId: command
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 369, 804, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Consolas"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#EAF2FF"
      text: node bin/hello-my-ppt.js serve --project C:\\path\\to\\my-deck
  - elementId: final
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 472, 864, 24]
    content:
      color: "#AFC8DC"
      fontSize: 12
      text: hello-my-ppt · local editor · editable PPTX · page images
